{"verse_key": "13:27", "surah": 13, "verse": 27, "text_uthmani": "وَيَقُولُ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ لَوْلَآ أُنزِلَ عَلَيْهِ ءَايَةٌ مِّن رَّبِّهِۦ ۗ قُلْ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُضِلُّ مَن يَشَآءُ وَيَهْدِىٓ إِلَيْهِ مَنْ أَنَابَ", "translation": "And those who disbelieved say, \"Why has a sign not been sent down to him from his Lord?\" Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Indeed, Allāh leaves astray whom He wills and guides to Himself whoever turns back [to Him] -", "verse_from_ms": 670960, "verse_to_ms": 694600, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَيَقُولُ", "start_ms": 670960, "end_ms": 672230}, {"i": 1, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 672230, "end_ms": 673170}, {"i": 2, "text": "كَفَرُوا۟", "start_ms": 673170, "end_ms": 674010}, {"i": 3, "text": "لَوْلَآ", "start_ms": 674010, "end_ms": 675800}, {"i": 4, "text": "أُنزِلَ", "start_ms": 675800, "end_ms": 677340}, {"i": 5, "text": "عَلَيْهِ", "start_ms": 677340, "end_ms": 678090}, {"i": 6, "text": "ءَايَةٌ", "start_ms": 678090, "end_ms": 678970}, {"i": 7, "text": "مِّن", "start_ms": 678970, "end_ms": 680220}, {"i": 8, "text": "رَّبِّهِۦ", "start_ms": 680220, "end_ms": 681830}, {"i": 9, "text": "ۗ", "start_ms": 681830, "end_ms": 682140}, {"i": 10, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 682140, "end_ms": 683270}, {"i": 11, "text": "إِنَّ", "start_ms": 683270, "end_ms": 684150}, {"i": 12, "text": "ٱللَّهَ", "start_ms": 684150, "end_ms": 684940}, {"i": 13, "text": "يُضِلُّ", "start_ms": 684940, "end_ms": 685410}, {"i": 14, "text": "مَن", "start_ms": 685410, "end_ms": 688380}, {"i": 15, "text": "يَشَآءُ", "start_ms": 688380, "end_ms": 690780}, {"i": 16, "text": "وَيَهْدِىٓ", "start_ms": 690780, "end_ms": 691580}, {"i": 17, "text": "إِلَيْهِ", "start_ms": 691580, "end_ms": 691870}, {"i": 18, "text": "مَنْ", "start_ms": 691870, "end_ms": 694545}, {"i": 19, "text": "أَنَابَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}